      "instruction_count": 64,
      "description": "Loads a5=$FF19E8; returns immediately if +$A4!=0; bypasses to dispatcher 0x012FFC if +$A2!=0; clears $FF1989; calls 0x00E682 and 0x011A4C; ticks 40-frame ($28) timer +$8E to deduct 1 SP from +$8E(a5) (dismissing via 0x0136CC on 0); toggles +$36 bit 1 when SP<=1. On +$86(a6)!=0 damage: clears +$86, sets +$83=max(8, ((+$83++ $82)*2)&$FF), clears +$82, subtracts (+$86&$0FFF) from +$8E(a5) clamped >=0, loads attacker +$7E->a0, sets +$39 bit 3 if d7 bit 13 set, enters State $04, copies +$84 facing (bchg #1 if bit 0 set), adds +$0C+=1 if facing!=0 and +$10+=3, calls 0x008EF8 (d0=$0C) & 0x013764, and dispatches via 10-entry jump table 0x013008..0x01301C (State $12 targets rts at 0x01301C).",
